  t["<strong style=\"color:var(--bad)\">Se descontrola.</strong> Con este retardo, esa ganancia ya no vale."] = "<strong style=\"color:var(--bad)\">It runs out of control.</strong> With this delay, that gain no longer works.";
  t["<strong style=\"color:var(--bad)\">Se ha ido de las manos.</strong> Con esos ajustes el bucle se descontrola."] = "<strong style=\"color:var(--bad)\">It has got out of hand.</strong> With those settings the loop runs out of control.";
  t["<strong style=\"color:var(--bad)\">Sin caso base</strong>: aunque cada ficha tire a la siguiente, si nadie empuja la primera <strong>no cae ninguna</strong>. El paso inductivo solo no demuestra nada."] = "<strong style=\"color:var(--bad)\">Without a base case</strong>: even though each domino knocks over the next, if nobody pushes the first <strong>none of them falls</strong>. The inductive step on its own proves nothing.";
