  t["Calcular $A^{50}$ multiplicando cincuenta veces no es una opción. La estrategia de examen es calcular $A^2$, $A^3$ y a veces $A^4$, <strong>buscar el patrón</strong> y justificarlo. Casi siempre aparece uno de estos comportamientos:"] = "Working out $A^{50}$ by multiplying fifty times is not an option. The exam strategy is to work out $A^2$, $A^3$ and sometimes $A^4$, <strong>look for the pattern</strong> and justify it. Almost always one of these behaviours appears:";
  t["Calcular $\\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix}$ desarrollando por una fila."] = "Work out $\\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix}$ by expanding along a row.";
  t["Calcular $\\det A$. Si es cero, no hay inversa y se acabó."] = "Work out $\\det A$. If it is zero, there is no inverse and that is that.";
