  t["Como $V_R < V_D$, quedan $"] = "Since $V_R < V_D$, there are $";
  t["Como $V_R \\ge V_D$, le llega para todas: la ley de la variedad requerida se cumple y puede regular del todo."] = "Since $V_R \\ge V_D$, it has enough for them all: the law of requisite variety is satisfied and it can regulate fully.";
  t["Como $\\Delta > 0$ hay dos soluciones distintas."] = "Since $\\Delta > 0$ there are two different solutions.";
