  t["Saltarla, porque seguramente no cae"] = "Skip it, because it probably will not come up";
  t["Salto"] = "Jump";
  t["Salto de "] = "A jump of ";
  t["Salto: $"] = "Jump: $";
  t["Saludos"] = "Greetings";
  t["Salvo en los extremos ($\\pm 1$), cada valor del seno o del coseno lo alcanzan dos ángulos por vuelta."] = "Except at the extremes ($\\pm 1$), each value of the sine or cosine is reached by two angles per turn.";
  t["Sarrus solo funciona con matrices 3×3. Para cualquier tamaño hace falta otra idea: reducir el determinante a determinantes más pequeños. Dos definiciones y una regla bastan."] = "Sarrus works only with 3×3 matrices. For any size another idea is needed: reducing the determinant to smaller determinants. Two definitions and one rule are enough.";
  t["Sarrus solo vale para $3\\times 3$. Un $4\\times 4$ se desarrolla por adjuntos."] = "Sarrus works only for $3\\times 3$. A $4\\times 4$ is expanded by cofactors.";
  t["Saturación y windup"] = "Saturation and windup";
  t["Saturación, windup y sintonía de Ziegler-Nichols"] = "Saturation, windup and Ziegler-Nichols tuning";
  t["Se acaba en "] = "It ends in ";
  t["Se acabó de construir. Este último tema no explica nada nuevo: es para <strong>usar</strong> lo que hay, ver el camino entero de una vez y, si te apetece, seguir por tu cuenta. Empieza por mirar lo que se ha montado en dieciocho fichas."] = "The building is over. This last topic explains nothing new: it is for <strong>using</strong> what is there, seeing the whole route at once and, if you feel like it, carrying on by yourself. Start by looking at what has been built in eighteen cards.";
  t["Se afina con $f = f_s/(N + \\frac{1}{2})$; el error en cents es $1200\\log_2$ del cociente, y crece en las notas agudas."] = "It is tuned with $f = f_s/(N + \\frac{1}{2})$; the error in cents is $1200\\log_2$ of the ratio, and it grows in the high notes.";
  t["Se afina eliminando los batidos: cuando desaparecen, las frecuencias coinciden."] = "You tune by eliminating the beats: when they disappear, the frequencies coincide.";
  t["Se ajusta el modelo "] = "The model fitted is ";
