  t["Suma: $(6-2)\\cdot 180 = 720^\\circ$; entre 6 ángulos iguales, $120^\\circ$. Por eso tres hexágonos encajan alrededor de un punto: $3\\cdot 120 = 360$."] = "Sum: $(6-2)\\cdot 180 = 720^\\circ$; shared among 6 equal angles, $120^\\circ$. That is why three hexagons fit round a point: $3\\cdot 120 = 360$.";
  t["Suma: la regla del paralelogramo"] = "Addition: the parallelogram rule";
