  t["»</em><br><br>¿Cuál de las dos se está aplicando?"] = "”</em><br><br>Which of the two is being applied?";
  t["»</em><br><br>¿Es <strong>esencial</strong> —tiene que mantenerse dentro de unos límites o el sistema no sobrevive— o <strong>instrumental</strong> —puede variar mucho, y de hecho varía para proteger a las esenciales—?"] = "”</em><br><br>Is it <strong>essential</strong> —it has to stay within limits or the system does not survive— or <strong>instrumental</strong> —it can vary a lot, and in fact varies in order to protect the essential ones—?";
  t["»</em><br><br>¿Qué conviene aquí, ventana <strong>grande</strong> o <strong>pequeña</strong>?"] = "”</em><br><br>Which is right here, a <strong>large</strong> or a <strong>small</strong> window?";
